    <section class="team-section sec-padding team-page president-messagege">
        <div class="thm-container" style="background: transparent;">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-12 tbg">
                    <div class="sec-title">
                        <h2><span>National President Message</span></h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-3 col-sm-4">
                        <div class="single-team-member img-cap-effect">
                            <div class="img-box">
                                <img src="Upload/memphotos/Prithviraj-Kothari.jpg" alt="Prithviraj-Kothari">
                            </div>
                            <div class="content">
                                <div class="name-box">
                                    <h3>Prithviraj Kothari</h3>
                                    <span>National President</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-9 col-sm-8">
                        <!--<h3>National President Message</h3>-->
                        <div class="col-md-12" style="display: none">
                            <h3 class="sub-heading pb-5 plr">IBJA has recently successfully completed four major events as under:</h3>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-lg-12 col-md-12 featured-service-box" style="display: none">
                            <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-6 boxx-team">
                                <div class="single-featured-service">
                                    <a href="https://goldengirlsaward.com/" target="_blank">
                                        <header>
                                            <div class="icon-box">
                                                <img src="images/Golden-Girl-Award-logo.jpg" width="150" alt="Logo">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="title-box">
                                                <h3><span>Golden Girl Award</span></h3>
                                            </div>
                                        </header>
                                        <article>
                                            <p>This award were given to promising and upcoming women entrepreneur of the industry.</p>
                                        </article>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-6 boxx-team">
                                <div class="single-featured-service">
                                    <a href="https://www.ibjafashionshow.in/" target="_blank">
                                        <header>
                                            <div class="icon-box">
                                                <img src="images/IBJA-Fashion-Show-logo.jpg" width="150" alt="Card image cap">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="title-box">
                                                <h3><span>IBJA Fashion Show</span></h3>
                                            </div>
                                        </header>
                                        <article>
                                            <p>The world class jewellery was showcased through fashion show with Bollywood stars.</p>
                                        </article>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-6 boxx-team">
                                <div class="single-featured-service">
                                    <a href="https://iibsummit.in/" target="_blank">
                                        <header>
                                            <div class="icon-box">
                                                <img src="images/IIBS-logo.jpg" width="150" alt="Logo">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="title-box">
                                                <h3><span>India International Bullion Summit (IIBS)-8</span></h3>
                                            </div>
                                        </header>
                                        <article>
                                            <p>The conference was attended by +450 delegate to discuss, Issues in Bullion Refining Industry, Digital Gold V/S ETF V/S EGR and Pride of India-Indian Jewellery Manufacturers and Craftsmanship etc.</p>
                                        </article>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-6 boxx-team">
                                <div class="single-featured-service">
                                    <a href="https://ibjawards.in/" target="_blank">
                                        <header>
                                            <div class="icon-box">
                                                <img src="images/IBJA-Award-logo.jpg" width="150" alt="Logo">
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="title-box">
                                                <h3><span>IBJA Award</span></h3>
                                            </div>
                                        </header>
                                        <article>
                                            <p>IBJA annual award were given to deserving industry stalwarts.</p>
                                        </article>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="col-md-12" style="margin-top: 30px;">
                            <p class="sub-heading pb-5" style="text-align: justify !important;">Gold prices have been climbing steadily over the past few months, recently hitting record highs due to a combination of factors. Geopolitical tensions and inflation concerns are driving investors to safe-haven assets. With potential interest rate cuts by major central banks, holding gold becomes more attractive due to lower opportunity costs. A weakening US dollar would likely boost gold demand, making it more affordable for buyers using other currencies. Amid global economic uncertainty and trade-related concerns like tariff wars, gold's appeal as a safe-haven asset continues to grow, supporting its current upward trend. </p>

                            <p class="sub-heading pb-5" style="text-align: justify !important;">At IBJA, we remain committed to empowering our members with the tools and knowledge necessary to thrive in these complex markets. Our initiatives, such as the Verified Tag Holder for Platinum Members, ensure that online accounts represent legitimate businesses and trusted brands. We also offer Targeted Promotions through our Product Promotion Platform, amplifying products and brands across our social channels.</p>

                            <p class="sub-heading pb-5" style="text-align: justify !important;">Industry education and awareness are crucial to our mission. We provide ongoing webinars and seminars to uplift knowledge and skills, enabling our members to stay ahead of the curve. Our Government Scheme Support and Policy Collaboration efforts bridge industry needs with public initiatives, driving greater impact. </p>

                            <p class="sub-heading pb-5" style="text-align: justify !important;">We are excited to host the India International Bullion Summit-11 (IIBS-11), a premier gathering of top market leaders from bullion and jewellery trading, mining and refining, central banks, exchanges, logistics, media, and government representatives. This event will foster collaboration, innovation, and growth, and the IBJA Awards Ceremony will honor exemplary contributions that drive our trade forward.</p>

                            <p class="sub-heading pb-5" style="text-align: justify !important;">
                                I would like to express my gratitude to everyone who participated in the IBJA Bhagyaxlaxmi Festival Scheme 2025. With over 55,000 coupons issued and 1,201 prizes awarded, the event was a great success. We appreciate your support and look forward to more exciting opportunities together.</

            <p class="sub-heading pb-5" style="text-align: justify !important;">Thank you for your trust and partnership. Together, we will shape a bright and prosperous future for the Indian gems and jewellery industry, maintaining a global perspective and unwavering commitment to excellence.</p>

                                <br />
                                <p class="sub-heading pb-5" style="text-align: left !important;">Thanking You.</p>
                                <p class="sub-heading pb-5" style="text-align: left !important;">Prithviraj Kothari</p>
                                <p class="sub-heading pb-5" style="text-align: left !important;">National President</p>
                                <p class="sub-heading pb-5" style="text-align: left !important;">India Bullion and Jewellers Association Ltd.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
